mission "The Black Tide Ambush"
    name "The Black Tide Ambush"
    description "Break a pirate screen that is preventing the scholar's launch from reaching the shoals."
    source "Last Light"
    destination "Mariner's Rest"
    reward 1330
    speaker offer "Captain Sabine Voss"
    speaker visit "Captain Sabine Voss"
    speaker complete "Captain Sabine Voss"
    to offer
        has "Three Flags at Dusk: done"
    objective kills 2
    battlefield "The Black Tide" 10400 5500
    enemy "Voss's Vanguard"
    enemy "Voss's Second"
    on offer
        conversation
            `A scholar's launch lies outside the harbour, unable to reach the shoals. Pirate ships have formed a loose screen across the approach.`
            `Captain Sabine Voss points toward the waiting launch. "It carries the instruments we need. Those pirates are not merely robbing passers-by; they are keeping the scholar from reaching the water where the old expedition's trail leads."`
            choice
                `"I will not leave this unanswered. Tell me where to go."`
                    accept
                `"Is this about the Company, or someone behind it?"`
                    goto details
                `"The sea is dangerous enough without old grudges. No."`
                    close
            label details
                `Voss marks the channel on your chart. "Break the screen, but do not chase every sail over the horizon. We need the channel open long enough for the launch to get through."`
                choice
                    `"The trail is mine to follow. I will sail now."`
                        accept
                    `"Leave me out of it. I am done here."`
                        close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Black Tide Ambush. Break a pirate screen that is preventing the scholar's launch from reaching the shoals."
    on visit
        conversation
            `At Mariner's Rest, Voss studies the cleared approach. The scholar's launch can now reach the shoals and continue the survey. "They were paid to keep us away," Voss says. "That tells me we are getting close."`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Voss gives you a brief nod. "The launch is through, and the scholar has the water they need. I would rather have done it without firing a shot, but pirates rarely leave a channel open out of courtesy."`
        log "Completed The Black Tide Ambush. Received 1330 gold. Break a pirate screen that is preventing the scholar's launch from reaching the shoals."
